   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "type": "text",
   "text": "SAM3 per bird per frame is not free. it does not run at frame rate \u2014\na flock does not change in 33 ms, so capture is periodic and the cost\nis paid per sample, not per second.",
